Note on upstream sources:
  - Raw Moscow Exchange (MOEX) equity trade histories are NOT included in `data/`
    and are retrieved on demand from https://iss.moex.com by `experiments/fetch_moex.py`
    subject to the Moscow Exchange User Agreement and Market Data Policy.
  - Raw copyrighted article headlines from Lenta.ru are NOT included or redistributed.
